  "steps": [
    "Chop 12-15 juicy strawberries and add 1 cup of greek yogurt (not curd) to it. Also add 1 tbsp of zero calorie sweetner of choice (stevia/monkfruit extract). Mix it up and pour small clusters over a parchment sheet. Freeze this.",
    "Now melt some good quality low cal dark chocolate in a microwave and dip these frozen yogurt clusters in the dark chocolate. Make sure that the coating is thin so the calories don’t shoot up. Freeze again and dig in!",
    "Pro tip: Take it out of the freezer and let it sit for 5 mins before you dig in for a strawberry yogurt explosion."
  ],
